If you are upgrading from version 2.0.1,
you should simply recompile the DNSTools
binary and replace your current binary.

There have been no database schema changes,
and no changes to the PHP code, only the
C code for the 'dnstools' executable has
changed.

(Well, there is now an install script,
but it is *HIGHLY* recommended that you
do not run this unless you want to wipe
out your current installation and start
over from scratch)
